{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45","id":4906133110,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVApLyM8AAAABJG2mdg","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45","diff_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45","number":45,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: 修复中文金额解析、源文事件去重与评分","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"针对 #42，修复普通中文金额的解析、同额不同事件的评分，以及模型裁剪原文后错误暴露精确金额的问题。金额相等只有在引文和值的全部发生位置能唯一绑定同一事件时才得分；原始输出、原文位置、拒收理由、历史记录与人工确认入口保留。\n\n- 金额存在性分为明确金额、明确非金额和待核三种；无数值工资/币种标签拒收，未知与遮盖金额不变成零。有限币种、范围、概数、算式及费率保护同时检查裁剪前源文，无法确认的关联不进入计算。\n- 主体、期间、角色和完成性按局部事件核对，同额不同事件保留为不同事实，重复位置或跨事件拼接不能借一次字面命中得分。日期与金额等价规则保持有限，不按模型输出补别名。\n- 跨页停止金额表达式拼接；同页须有明确续片或连续版面证据，未知边界保留核对。共享金额续文守护覆盖已有外币词表，缺少版面坐标不会使评测候选被异常丢弃。旧历史金额只降级，不自动升级或改写。\n- 验收脚本保留失败、原始模型响应和进程退出证据；历史v6检查从绑定字节的归档运行，原冻结文件不改写。\n\n最终应用提交 `e99df1d3061f60b07fd9fa3e0df39f896f97f695`：本地 `npm run check` 通过（Vitest 1789项/46文件；材料67通过/1平台跳过；运行时8666通过/1平台跳过）。锁定HTTP 388项全部通过，389份合成原输出与修前一致，重启核查387案例和清理通过；独立补充27项在Node24/26均通过。精确提交CI运行中，尚不称为通过。新增反例有固定修前失败，完整检查暴露的80叶回归与中间HTTP失败均另存；六个旧测试仅纠正同页续片的页码元数据，原断言不变。\n\n实验数据和同输出复评另见依赖本PR的 #46。技术回归、隔离Worker/D1/R2接口执行、CI和非专家公开材料评测各自说明，均不替代真实案件或人工业务验收。本PR未合并、未训练、未部署生产。Issue #42 在合并和业务验收条件满足前保持打开。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:35:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a3191b454ee975233238aaf1635565ba5719b272","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/e99df1d3061f60b07fd9fa3e0df39f896f97f695","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-guards","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-guards","sha":"e99df1d3061f60b07fd9fa3e0df39f896f97f695","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/events{/priva